{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "04eee66fd7450a58340c0b9b939a3e14e294bc188172cbe70fa167ef5a546f34", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影後", "zh": "写真工作　拍摄后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9000_place", "source_sha256": "a32567de6543d0a96cbc609ee543d86d504ced11d4d2f11c660faa968b299517", "ja": "クラブ", "zh": "俱乐部", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9001_p", "source_sha256": "51400e736401fdc486d036fd88911dc633119ffe033b4c7b428f6bcfc3efc431", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が終了。\nまつりの『HIP HOPレディ』にみんな熱狂していた）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄结束了。\n大家都被茉莉的《HIP HOP淑女》彻底点燃了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9002_021mat", "source_sha256": "9319fc4af99c21d2112c20f9f8e2a5bc17dee0d00b9ba61af17f4c9bca6f23c2", "ja": "お疲れ様なのです。そーくーる！なラップを\nたくさん披露できて、姫も楽しかったのです♪", "zh": "辛苦大家了哦。能展示这么多“超酷！”的说唱，公主我也很开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9003_p", "source_sha256": "de23792ceede3e07ab6b659e608cbd7ced29130646587061581c12eef3d399ed", "ja": "すごく伝わってきたよ。だからかな……\n普段のまつりとは違う頼もしさを感じたな。", "zh": "我深深感受到了。所以说……  \n我感觉到了平时的茉莉所没有的那种可靠感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9004_021mat", "source_sha256": "5a68d458de0b0829c9f9c50d03454101cdd8707cf92e464a7ab48a5d400534ce", "ja": "ほ？　確かに、いつもと違う感じにはしましたが……\nどう感じたか、気になるのです。", "zh": "哦？确实，我是做出了和往常不同的感觉……\n我很在意你是怎么感觉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9005_p", "source_sha256": "671b888488e31761bb98ab15fb9a007ee959852fdb743d44e870ab74a03bddd0", "ja": "そうだな……まつりにラップの世界に誘われてる、\nそんな感じかな？", "zh": "是啊……感觉就像被茉莉邀请进入说唱的世界一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9006_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4c433cd9a85a1241003f1421c32d5fc4e4aae0f4336443de6dbb2cc91c52a8d", "ja": "ふふっ、{$P$}さんなら、いつでも、\nどこへでも手を引いてお招きするのですよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，要是{$P$}先生的话，无论何时、无论何地，我都会牵着你的手邀请你前往哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9007_021mat", "source_sha256": "cc38bb0f5b7ca8075df191df1f5572654c2e698ab5a91fafff0947d569d3017e", "ja": "そのときは、どんな姫に手を引かれてみたいですか？", "zh": "到那时，您想被怎样的公主牵着手呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9008", "source_sha256": "3b71f785be06c3cab7d78a319f6491365887fcc27d5e561de2cb76f4b0868c44", "ja": "クールなまつり", "zh": "酷飒的茉莉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9009", "source_sha256": "3c46b0f79c8229759bf922d6d974a76cff44da4eefad2032a61bda883e7b0a4d", "ja": "オトナなまつり", "zh": "成熟的祭典", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9200_p", "source_sha256": "7098d963bda7c47201075249b59650606753a3d37951462ba4a5ced728db6280", "ja": "今日みたいにクールな……カッコいいまつりかな。\n自信に溢れた人と一緒にいたら、ドキッとしそうだ。", "zh": "像是今天这样酷酷的……帅气的茉莉吧。\n和充满自信的人在一起，感觉会让人心跳加速呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9201_021mat", "source_sha256": "91490100f0a49ca54729a9b89935fe42665a95b136d08b0b07a8d6cf73543c98", "ja": "それなら、今日の姫にお任せなのです！　ラップや\n音楽の力でたくさんのドキドキをお届けするのですよ♪", "zh": "那就交给今天的公主吧！用说唱和音乐的力量，为大家带来满满的心动哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9202_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5e41be7226acc772da65fc3ec04672ff793fbc8a58f6469db6242a56a023642", "ja": "キラキラな舞踏会とは違う、\n刺激的で忘れられない夜に……。さぁ、準備はいい？", "zh": "与闪闪发光的舞会不同，  \n这是一个刺激又令人难忘的夜晚……来，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9300_p", "source_sha256": "7098d963bda7c47201075249b59650606753a3d37951462ba4a5ced728db6280", "ja": "今日みたいにクールな……カッコいいまつりかな。\n自信に溢れた人と一緒にいたら、ドキッとしそうだ。", "zh": "像是今天这样酷酷的……帅气的茉莉吧。\n和充满自信的人在一起，感觉会让人心跳加速呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9301_021mat", "source_sha256": "94203cd80af7745d467af71541b27edcd6616684ce981372b3440d1b14bb3db8", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、それでいいのですか？\n姫なら、いつでもドキドキしていたいのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生这样就可以了么？\n如果是公主的话，无论何时都希望能心跳不已呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9302_021mat", "source_sha256": "504551d6bd8a557aac87a6a4dd3079493878a89d71e73cd873cc658008a8ea7b", "ja": "クールなまつりの魔法は、お家に帰っても解けることは\nないのです。ずっと、ドキドキなのですよ。……ね♪", "zh": "酷酷的茉莉魔法，就算回到家也不会失效哦。会一直心跳不已的。……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9500_p", "source_sha256": "0cf06652e9e8663450c029502849cff4d0e26bcf9ba3a4f172bbe6bc5cef1b64", "ja": "それなら、オトナなまつりを見てみたいな。こういう\n特別な場所でしか見られないから、気になるよ。", "zh": "既然如此，那我还挺想看看成熟大人的茉莉呢。毕竟只能在这种特别的场合才能见到，挺让人在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9501_021mat", "source_sha256": "d5896595916fb27d10322cb8c631c6ce9f0c1bd96e7c68b7e8d330464116a000", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さんは欲張りさん\nなのです。もっとオトナな姫が見たいなんて……。", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生可真贪心呢。竟然还想看看更加成熟的公主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9502_021mat", "source_sha256": "cab03e2182e0b325e996956172b9051592993c495612b01c0a4bda646450ed1a", "ja": "でも……ふふっ。今日だけは特別なのです。\n姫の大胆さに、トリコになっても知らないのですよ♪", "zh": "不过……呵呵，今天可是特别的哦。要是被公主大胆的一面迷住了，可别怪我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9600_p", "source_sha256": "0cf06652e9e8663450c029502849cff4d0e26bcf9ba3a4f172bbe6bc5cef1b64", "ja": "それなら、オトナなまつりを見てみたいな。こういう\n特別な場所でしか見られないから、気になるよ。", "zh": "既然如此，那我还挺想看看成熟大人的茉莉呢。毕竟只能在这种特别的场合才能见到，挺让人在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9601_021mat", "source_sha256": "b018fbb43d12dee6b09d5487fee2c8fbe316cee4e486bb0f9bd17f9cf261a74f", "ja": "なるほどなのです！　もちろん、今の姫なら\nでんじゃらす！なオーラも出せるのですが……。", "zh": "原来如此！当然，现在的本宫也能散发出危险的气场，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_9602_021mat", "source_sha256": "871ef0e3edf2414a52cd82d74aa93531d6645e5e85bc5108a97a8b0d5ffab0e8", "ja": "いつもの姫と違いすぎて、ビックリするかもしれないの\nです……。だから今日は、お預けなのです♪", "zh": "因为和往常的公主差别太大，可能会让你大吃一惊呢……所以今天就先暂时不展示啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
